    <briefdescription>
<para>Pricing engine for European discrete geometric average price Asian. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implements a discrete geometric average price Asian option, with European exercise. The formula is from &quot;Asian
       Option&quot;, E. Levy (1997) in &quot;Exotic Options: The State of the
       Art&quot;, edited by L. Clewlow, C. Strickland, pag 65-97</para><para><xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000052"><xreftitle>Possible enhancements</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>implement correct theta, rho, and dividend-rho calculation</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para><para><xrefsect id="test_1_test000087"><xreftitle>Tests</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>the correctness of the returned value is tested by reproducing results available in literature.</para></listitem><listitem><para>the correctness of the available greeks is tested against numerical calculations.</para></listitem></itemizedlist>
</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
